{"path":"std/fs/fn.read_to_string.html","title":"Function read_to_string","description":"Reads the entire contents of a file into a string.","body":{"type":"document","children":[{"type":"anchor","id":"main-content"},{"type":"heading","level":1,"id":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Function read_to_string"}]},{"type":"text","value":"1.26.0 · "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/src/std/fs.rs.html#383-393","title":null,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Source"}]},{"type":"code_block","language":null,"code":"pub fn read_to_string<P: AsRef<Path>>(path: P) -> Result<String>"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reads the entire contents of a file into a string."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is a convenience function for using "},{"type":"link","href":"std/fs/struct.File.html#method.open","title":"associated function std::fs::File::open","children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"File::open"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/io/trait.Read.html#method.read_to_string","title":"method std::io::Read::read_to_string","children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"read_to_string"}]},{"type":"text","value":" with fewer imports and without an intermediate variable."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"id":"errors","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Errors"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This function will return an error if "},{"type":"inline_code","code":"path"},{"type":"text","value":" does not already exist. Other errors may also be returned according to "},{"type":"link","href":"std/fs/struct.OpenOptions.html#method.open","title":"method std::fs::OpenOptions::open","children":[{"type":"inline_code","code":"OpenOptions::open"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the contents of the file are not valid UTF-8, then an error will also be returned."}]},{"type":"paragraph","chi